Server init.
>> a := Blob entsha: 4.
a bytes: ( Uluhlu entsha ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob entsha: 4.
b bytes: ( Uluhlu entsha ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a entsha.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Imveliso bhala: ( a ^ c ), umgca-omtsha. } bamba: { :e Imveliso bhala: e, umgca-omtsha. }, qala.
a khulula.
b khulula.
